# Claude Code with Kiro Crew (web dashboard on port 5476, app backends on 9100+)
#
# The claude-kirocrew image has Kiro Crew (https://kiro.dev) with Claude Code over ACP
# as its agent harness. Kiro Crew apps run a backend of their own that their page loads
# from 127.0.0.1 in your browser (the first app gets 9100, the next 9101, and so on),
# so those ports are forwarded too. Only ports that something listens on matter; add
# more with `openshell forward start -d PORT <sandbox>`. The policy allows Kiro Crew
# updates, the app store, GitHub clones and package registries. For a run with no
# network access at all, use the kirocrew-readonly profile.
agent=claude
image=claude-kirocrew:latest
policy=kirocrew
cmd=kirocrew-start
forward=5476,9100,9101,9102
